    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89464" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκαθ-έζομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εδοῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					1.18
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εσθήσομαι</span>
			f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.167
			</span></i>: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκαθεζόμην</span>:—<i>sit
				down before</i> a town, <i>besiege</i> it, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					8.7.6
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				3.98.7
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.134
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιορκία π</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.5.21
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>watch carefully</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς πράγμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.</div>
